{"id":"00192","root":"uni00192_1","name":{"ja":"ウィムル","en":"Wemour"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ウィムル","en":"Wemour"},"element":"Science","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-05-17","limited":false,"characterId":151,"profile":{"ja":"米連が研究している『強化魔族』の実験体とされてしまった魔族。魔族でありながら長い時を人間界で生き、強大な魔力と、高い生命力を持つが、争いを好まない性質ゆえに人の住まない土地でひっそりと暮らしていた。だが、その力と性質に目をつけた米連軍に捕獲され、研究所に送られたウィムルは、強化実験のため体内に様々な機械を埋め込む改造を受けさせられる。その結果、元々高い戦闘能力は凄まじいものとなり、魔力を吸い上げて強化された武器による一撃は絶大な威力を誇る。ウィムルは無理矢理与えられたこの力を嫌悪し、戦いのたびにいっそ負けることを望むようになるが、生命力に加えて強靭な防御装備を備えた肉体は、大抵の攻撃を無力化してしまう。ならばせめて苦しませないようにと一撃で相手を屠るうちに、皆恐れから彼女に近づかなくなり、常に孤独を感じている。基地内にある軟禁部屋で編み物をしたり、読書をしたりと静かに過ごしている時だけが癒やしの時間。やがて日本の基地へと派遣されたウィムルは、対魔忍なら自身を討ってくれるのではないかと期待をしている。","en":"(Wemour, she/her) She is a demon classified by the United States as an experimental \"enhanced demon\" subject. Though a demon, she spent many years living in the Human Realm, possessing vast magical power and extraordinary vitality, yet she preferred a quiet life in uninhabited lands. The U.S. military captured her, sent her to a research facility, and implanted various machines within her body for enhancement experiments. As a result, her already high combat ability became overwhelming, and attacks powered by weapons that siphon magic deliver devastating force. Wemour loathes the power forced upon her and wishes to lose in battle, but her reinforced body and defenses neutralize most assaults. Consequently, she now ends fights with a single lethal blow to spare her opponents further suffering, causing everyone to keep their distance out of fear, leaving her perpetually lonely. She finds solace only in quiet moments spent knitting or reading in a confinement room on the base. Later dispatched to a Japanese base, she hopes a Taimanin might finally end her life."},"illustrator":"さくらんぼ","voiceActor":"柏木逢花","forms":[{"id":"uni00192_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1018,2036],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[144,288],"def":[109