"blo00009",1],[47,"blo00011",3],[47,"blo00012",1],[47,"blo00014",3],[47,"blo00015",1],[48,"blo00008",3],[48,"blo00009",1],[48,"blo00011",3],[48,"blo00012",1],[48,"blo00014",3],[48,"blo00015",1],[49,"blo00008",3],[49,"blo00009",1],[49,"blo00011",3],[49,"blo00012",1],[49,"blo00014",3],[49,"blo00015",1],[50,"blo00008",3],[50,"blo00009",1],[50,"blo00011",3],[50,"blo00012",1],[50,"blo00014",3],[50,"blo00015",1]]},"voices":[{"type":"new","label":"Acquired","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"ウィムル、と言います。こう見えて、とても強力な兵器なんですよ","en":"I'm Wemour. Don't let my appearance fool you—I'm a very powerful weapon."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_new_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":1,"text":{"ja":"さあ、私を殺すのはだれですか？　殺し損ねたらその死をお返しに差し上げましょう","en":"Now, who will kill me? If you fail, I'll return that death to you."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_1.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":2,"text":{"ja":"戦うための武器に作り変えられた私を、ウィムルと名前で呼んでくれるのですか？","en":"Will you call me Wemour by name, even though I've been turned into a weapon for battle?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_2.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":3,"text":{"ja":"よほど覚悟を決めてくれないと、私を殺すことはできませんよ？　私はとても強力な兵器なのです","en":"You'll have to be seriously prepared; you can't kill me otherwise. I'm an extremely powerful weapon."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"また編み上がってしまいました。あげる相手もいないのに……兵器が編み物なんておかしいですよね？","en":"I've knitted again. No one to give it to… A weapon that knits—how absurd is that?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"できれば殺し合いなんかしたくないんです。でも、私を殺してもらうためには、もっと戦わなければならないんです","en":"I'd rather not fight at all. But if you're going to kill me, you'll have to fight even more."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"私の名前はウィムル。かつては魔族だった、米連の生体兵器です","en":"My name is Wemour. I was once a demon, a U.S. bio-weapon."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"できればただの魔族のウィムルとして死にたいのですが、でも兵器として作り変えられた私にはかなわぬ夢のようです","en":"I'd like to die just as a regular demon named Wemour, but the weapon I've become makes that dream impossible."},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_dmg_3.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_evo_1.ogg"},{"type":"evo","label":"Awakening","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_evo_2.ogg"},{"type":"lup","label":"Level Up","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_lup_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_msr_1.ogg"},{"type":"msr","label":"Mission","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_msr_2.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_rdy_1.ogg"},{"type":"rdy","label":"Battle Start","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_rdy_2.ogg"},{"type":"res","label":"Result","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_res_1.ogg"},{"type":"wav","label":"Wave","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00192_1/uni00192_1_wav_1.ogg"}],"trust":[100],"scenes":[["chr_0121_r18"]],"obtain":[{"kind":"spark","title":null,"need":100,"start":null,"end":null}],"standardPool":true,"art":{"graphicId":"uni_00192","graphicNum":2,"r18GraphicId":"uni_00192_r18","r18GraphicNum":2,"spineId":"Chr_0121"}}